 Fridmann in Upstate New York. [1] According to its creators, the album represents a return to their roots while exploring new sonic territories.\"}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0070-6aee8e99d800:d04\", \"text\": \"rather limp and unaccomplished ( and repeated ! ) inanities such as `` free your mind '' and `` shine on , '' phrases that should be confined , respectively , to the lexicons of aging hippies and Roger Waters . '' [ 32 ] Kevin Liedel was also critical of the album in a 2.5 out of 5 star review for Slant Magazine , writing that `` When not trudging through overly long tracks like `` Let Me Show You Love '' or clumsily paced ballads like `` Walking in the Sky '' , the group attempts some M83-like\"}], \"fallible_prior\": [\"En Vogue\"], \"prior_explanation\": \"The album 'Free Your Mind' was released by the American R&B group En Vogue in 1992. I am certain of this fact based on general music knowledge.\", \"fallible_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0070-6aee8e99d800:d00\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0070-6aee8e99d800:d00:c0\", \"entity\": \"Cut Copy\", \"scope\": \"Artist of the album \\\"Free Your Mind\\\"\", \"claim\": \"Free Your Mind is the fourth studio album by Australian electronic music band Cut Copy.\", \"answer\": \"Cut Copy\", \"quote\": \"Free Your Mind (Cut Copy album) Free Your Mind is the fourth studio album by Australian electronic music band Cut Copy, released on 1 November 2013 by Modular Recordings.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0070-6aee8e99d800:d01\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0070-6aee8e99d800:d01:c0\", \"entity\": \"Cut Copy\", \"scope\": \"Artist of the album \\\"Free Your Mind\\\"\", \"claim\": \"The album \\\"Free Your Mind\\\" is by Cut Copy.\", \"answer\": \"Cut Copy\", \"quote\": \"Neon Love In Ghost Colours Zonoscope Free Your Mind Haiku from Zero Freeze , Melt Extended plays I Thought of Numbers Mix albums FabricLive.29 Singles `` Hearts on Fire `` `` Lights & Music `` `` Take Me Over `` Related Cut Copy disc